ht|n|at|^*GA1,1.  A DONT double^*N|
                  
ht|o|at|^*GA2,2.  You don't preempt in 4th seat^*N|
                  
ht|p|at|^*GA3,3.  Responding to 2@C opener with a bust hand^*N|
                  
ht|q|at|^*GA4,4.  Kickback RKCB^*N|
                  
ht|r|at|^*GA5,5.  You do not underlead aces against suits^*N|
                  
ht|s|at|^*GA6,6.  Leading away from KJ10 is normally not a good idea^*N|


