Hand 3
https://tinyurl.com/24nkvfrx

qx|A3|st||rh||ah|Board 3 IMPs   -   May 22, 2024|pn|hondo717,IraCT,danpsych,Sputniks|
md|1SKQJT3HAQDAKJ9C96,S54HJT5D8763CQ852,S98H9742DT542C743,SA762HK863DQCAKJT|sv|e|MB|?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|This is an interesting hand. To open 2@C you need 4 |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=quicktricks,Quick Trick^*N|CP||FP||at| and I do have 4.5 (1 in spades, 1.5 in hearts, and 2 in diamonds) with 9 tricks (NOT 4 LOSERS). I can count 4 spades 2 diamonds and 1 heart for sure which is only 7. |
PG| ***** 43 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I might add another trick because I can count an extra half for the @HQ and @DJ each. That only gets me to 8 and not enough. I would open 2N with a more balanced hand with the same HCP. On the other hand, I really like the hand. I am going to stretch and open 2@C.|
PG| ***** 44 ***** |


mb|2C|mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|2D|mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|MB|?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Now I am going to explain how I play over over strong 2@C bids. Some play that 2@D is a "positive" response showing at least one king or ace or at least 6 HCP. And that 2@H over 2@C is a "bust" with less than that. If we played that, North has a clear 2@H bid.|
PG| ***** 45 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I don't like that because it sometimes wrong sides the hand when opener has hearts. So I play something called 2nd negative when the 2@C opener rebids 2@H or 2@S over 2@D. With my hand I am going to bid 2@S.|
PG| ***** 46 ***** |


mb|2S|mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|MB|?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|If we play my way, North shows a bust hand by bidding 3@C. That is totally artificial. It denies 3 spades and shows a bust hand. With a bust hand and 3+ spades he would still bid 4@S.|
PG| ***** 47 ***** |


mb|3C|mb|P|MB|?|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Now I can stop in 3@S if I like or bid another suit which is forcing.|
PG| ***** 48 ***** |


mb|3D|mb|P|MB|?|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|North has to bid 4@D.|
PG| ***** 49 ***** |


mb|4D|mb|P|MB|?|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Now I might as well bid 4@S since that is game and hope for the best.|
PG| ***** 50 ***** |


mb|4S|mb|P|mb|P|mb|P|
pg| ***** 51 ***** |


