UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|2@H down is probably a reasonable result, maybe a smidge below average but not terrible. I guess we easily make 1N. So the balancing bid worked out fine. If you can get your partner to agree, remember to balance over 1N passed out with an appropriate DONT distribution.|
PG| ***** 93 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|It is actually better to balance the weaker you are because if the points are evenly spread and 4th seat has a weak hand that means partner, who is sitting behind the NT bidder has more points and your finesses are more likely to work.|
PG| ***** 94 ***** |


